msgstr "Quitar de seguir la seria %s ?"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintsysadm/page_kernels.py:1276
msgid ""
"Without tracking, this computer will no longer receive security updates for "
"this kernel series."
msgstr ""
"Sens seguiment, aqueste ordenador recebrà pas mai las mesas a jorn de "
"seguretat d’aquesta seria de nuclèus."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintsysadm/page_kernels.py:1296
#, python-format
